    "globalConstraints": "- The run compiles and dispatches from `.ultrapowers/plan.md` alone: kata holds run state and never the plan, and nothing that reads the plan consults kata.\n- No worker is handed a kata tool, URL or token: every kata request is driver code \u2014 `fleet/launch.mjs` on the laptop, `fleet/run-main.mjs`/`fleet/run-engine.mjs` and `fleet/sandbox-boot.sh` on the sandbox \u2014 and no worker environment carries a variable beginning `KATA_`.\n- No secret is committed and none rides an argv on the laptop: the kata bearer exists only in `/etc/kata/kata.env` on the hub (delivered over ssh on stdin, never in the setup script) and in `~/.ultrapowers/kata-hub.env` on the laptop; the laptop's own requests source it on the hub; the sandbox holds no kata token at all, because the edge injects it.\n- Nothing here touches `fleet/referee.mjs`, the `examLanding` option, or any referee symbol; the sheet's consumers are the engine's dispatch, exam handoff and fold ownership, and the export on the tag.\n\n**Acceptance:** suite \u2014 the committed suite plus per-task review is the verification; the pre-registered readings in the Goal are taken on the first run after this merges, not on this run.",
